- 1 spec passed in 12.5 s; CEF turnover, page load, capability after turnover, second browser session, coordinated exit, owned-process disappearance and native-WebView disappearance all completed.
- This closes the local macOS proof. Windows/Linux remain CI and handoff responsibilities.
